margin-right: auto;\"><b>On a scale from 1 to 5, how understandable is this test?<\/b><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: #666; font-size: 14px; max-width: 1250px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">(1 = very hard to understand, 5 = very easy to understand)<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"P1_T02","QuestionID":"QID38","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Test 2 protected IndexedCollection decorateUniqueCollection(final Collection collection) { return...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"Understandability of Test"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":7,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"1 \u2013 Very hard to understand"},"2":{"Display":"2 \u2013 Hard"},"3":{"Display":"3 \u2013 Neutral"},"4":{"Display":"4 \u2013 Easy"},"5":{"Display":"5 \u2013 Very easy to understand"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6i00wJNO8n2tTa6","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID4","SecondaryAttribute":"Part 1 \u2013 Rating Individual Tests \u00a0 In this section, you will see 15 test cases, one per page. For","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<blockquote><b>Part 1 \u2013 Rating Individual Tests<\/b><\/blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>&nbsp;<\/blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>In this section, you will see <b>13 test cases<\/b>, one per page.<\/blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>For each test:<\/blockquote>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n\t<blockquote>read the code<\/blockquote>\n\t<\/li>\n\t<li>\n\t<blockquote>rate how understandable it is (1\u20135)<\/blockquote>\n\t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<blockquote>&nbsp;<\/blockquo